onstant%2C%20where%20%60literal%60%20tells%0A%20%2A%20whether%20a%20literal%20gives%20its%20value.%20%60options%60%20are%20%7B%40link%20selfTranslate%7D%27s.%0A%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20selfTranslationSignatures%28source%2C%20language%2C%20options%20%3D%20%7B%7D%29%20%7B%0A%20%20if%20%28family%28required%28language%29%29%20%21%3D%3D%20%27JavaScript%27%29%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20throw%20new%20SelfTranslationError%28%60signatures%20are%20read%20from%20JavaScript%20or%20TypeScript%20modules%2C%20not%20%24%7Blanguage%7D%60%29%3B%0A%20%20%7D%0A%20%20return%20translateModule%28source%2C%20language%2C%20%27Rust%27%2C%20options%2C%20true%29.signatures%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20translateModule%28source%2C%20sourceLanguage%2C%20targetLanguage%2C%20%7B%20decorators%2C%20moduleDirectory%20%3D%20%5B%5D%2C%20imports%20%3D%20%7B%7D%2C%20utf16Strings%20%3D%20false%2C%20referenceSemantics%20%3D%20false%2C%20retainDiagnostics%20%3D%20false%20%7D%20%3D%20%7B%7D%2C%20signaturesOnly%20%3D%20false%29%20%7B%0A%20%20const%20from%20%3D%20required%28sourceLanguage%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20to%20%3D%20required%28targetLanguage%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20set%20%3D%20decoratorSet%28decorators%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20text%20%3D%20String%28source%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20bytes%20%3D%20Buffer.from%28text%2C%20%27utf8%27%29%3B%0A%20%20const%20parsed%20%3D%20parseProgrammingLanguage%28text%2C%20from%29%3B%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20Signature%20discovery%20still%20checks%20and%20translates%20every%20declaration.%20It%0A%20%20%2F%2F%20does%20not%20need%20a%20second%20complete%20source%20graph%20or%20a%20provenance%20envelope.%0A%20%20const%20reconstructed%20%3D%20signaturesOnly%20%3F%20bytes.toString%28%27utf8%27%29%20%3A%20LinkNetwork._parseWithLinks%28text%2C%20from%2C%20ParseConfiguration.default%28%29%2C%20parsed%29.network.reconstructText%28%29%3B%0A%20%20if%20%28reconstructed%20%21%3D%3D%20text%29%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20throw%20new%20SelfTranslationError%28%60the%20%24%7Bfrom%7D%20links%20of%20the%20source%20do%20not%20r